# SPRINT 20 — MULTI-AGENT COORDINATION & COLLABORATION

## Mission

Implement a production-grade, generic **Multi-Agent Coordination & Collaboration layer** on top of the existing architecture.

The architecture must become:

User Request
→ AG-001 Master Orchestrator
→ Intent / Context / Routing
→ Agent Selection
→ Coordination Plan
→ Agent A / Agent B / Agent C
→ Shared Coordination State
→ Result Collection
→ Conflict / Dependency Resolution
→ AG-001 Aggregation
→ Final Response

Sprint 20 must build reusable infrastructure only.

DO NOT implement business-specific Client AI, Freelancer AI, Marketplace AI, Marketing AI, or Admin AI agents in this sprint.

The goal is to make the platform capable of safely coordinating multiple generic agents later.

