# 7. TASK DECOMPOSITION

Create a generic task decomposition contract.

The coordinator must be able to receive a pre-built plan from AG-001.

Do NOT make LLM decomposition mandatory.

The system must work deterministically without an LLM.

If LLM-assisted decomposition is supported, it must:

* use the existing LLM abstraction
* use AIReasoningService
* respect token/context budgets
* validate structured output
* fail closed
* never execute arbitrary model instructions
* never bypass authorization

Deterministic plans must remain fully supported.

