# 9. AGENT INVOCATION

All managed agent executions must pass through the existing Agent Platform execution boundary.

Conceptually:

Coordinator
→ AgentPlatformGateway.beginExecution()
→ Agent
→ AgentPlatformGateway.endExecution()

Ensure `endExecution()` happens in `finally`.

Never allow a failed agent to leave an execution lease/concurrency slot open.

Unmanaged legacy agents must continue to work exactly as Sprint 19 designed.

